      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030318,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "莉莉亚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“那些人已经埋在地下，再也不会回到这个世界。/n　可我的手仍然脏着，仍然污秽。啊……”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10303180040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "304"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030318006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030318,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "莉莉亚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“亲爱的。我已经受够了。真的受够了。/n　不要，不要，不要……”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10303180050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "304"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030318007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030318,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "莉莉亚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（夫人和麦克白一起犯下罪行，/n　于是她认定原本干净的双手，已经被鲜血染红）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10303180060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "304"
    },
    {
